      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this bright and spacious three-bedroom mid-terrace family home to the market, ideally positioned within the ever-popular Lanesborough development in Finglas, Dublin 11.\n\nNo. 47 is ideally situated within this mature and well-established residential estate and is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers including first-time buyers, growing families and investors alike.\n\nThe location is second to none, with every conceivable amenity within arm's reach. Charlestown Shopping Centre, IKEA, DCU, schools, shops, parks and sporting facilities are all close by. The area is also well serviced by public transport, while the M50 motorway is only minutes away providing easy access to Dublin Airport, Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nBright and well laid out internal living accommodation extending to c. 87 sq.m comprises of an entrance hallway, spacious living room with feature fireplace and a large kitchen/dining area with direct access to the rear garden. Upstairs you will find three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, all complete with fitted wardrobes, and a main family bathroom.\n\nNo. 47 comes to the market in good condition throughout and offers a fantastic opportunity for any purchaser seeking a well-located home with the potential to put their own stamp on it. Additional benefits include gas fired central heating, a large driveway to the front providing off-street parking, no properties directly overlooking the home from the front. To the rear is a generous garden complete with a storage shed.\n\nThis is an ideal opportunity for buyers seeking a spacious home in a highly convenient and sought-after location. Early viewing is highly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0868323302 or 015411455 to arrange a viewing.\n\nKey Features\n• c. 87 sq.m\n• BER B\n• 3 Bed Mid Terrace Family Home\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Spacious living accommodation throughout\n• Large kitchen/dining area with access to rear garden\n• Feature fireplace in living room\n• Three well-proportioned bedrooms\n• Main family bathroom\n• Large driveway with off-street parking\n• Not overlooked to the front\n• Generous rear garden with storage shed\n• Located in a mature residential estate\n• Close to local amenities\n• Easy access to M50, Dublin Airport and City Centre\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, families and investors\n• Viewing highly advised"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 14"
      }
